<div class="c"><h1 class="redstar">Poetry By:Konrad</h1></div><h2 class="c">Don''t Worry</h2><p>I know you're gone,<br>  but I have to be strong<br>  and wait for another day.<br><br>I wish you were here with me,<br>  out watching the endless sea,<br>  and we could just sail away,<br>  leaving our troubles out of the way.<br><br>but that's OK.<br><br>You need time for yourself,<br>  so I'll put your pictures on the shelf,<br>  and pray God blesses your life,<br>  instead of worrying about being a wife.<br><br>Don't worry a lot about me,<br>  I'll be ok really you see,<br>  I'll find someone else to love,<br>  so you can be free my precious dove.<br><br>And if you return to my ranch,<br>  bring with you the olive branch,<br>  and we'll be happy you and me,<br>  From Here to Eternity.</p><hr width="50%" class="redstar"></body>
